    {
      "id": "ea099e1332084b59a0a902d45ab36035",
      "owner": "GeoffKeenan",
      "created": 1683721254000,
      "modified": 1683818996000,
      "guid": null,
      "name": null,
      "title": "Wards and Precincts 2022",
      "type": "Feature Service",
      "typeKeywords": [
        "ArcGIS Server",
        "Data",
        "Feature Access",
        "Feature Service",
        "Metadata",
        "Service",
        "Singlelayer",
        "Hosted Service"
      ],
      "description": "<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;\"><DIV><DIV><P STYLE=\"margin:0 0 0 0;\"><SPAN><SPAN>Voting precincts for the Commonwealth of Massachusetts. Established based on the 2020 Decennial Census by each municipality and approved by the Local Election Districts Review Commission (LEDRC) in accordance with state law.<\/SPAN><\/SPAN><\/P><P STYLE=\"margin:0 0 0 0;\"><SPAN><SPAN>These data reflect the statewide change in population for the Commonwealth of Massachusetts based on the 2020 Decennial Census and the new precinct and ward lines established by each municipality and reviewed and approved by the Local Election Districts Review Commission (LEDRC) in accordance with the procedures set forth in state law. The dataset represents those precincts and wards approved by the LEDRC being passed to the State Legislature for Redistricting.<\/SPAN><\/SPAN><\/P><P><SPAN /><\/P><\/DIV><\/DIV><\/DIV>",
      "tags": [
        "brockton",
        "wards",
        "voting"
      ],
      "snippet": "Precincts are geographic areas used by governments for elections.  In Massachusetts, precincts are combined into wards, which are usually used to define local election districts.  Only cities have both wards and precincts; municipalities designated as towns contain one or more precincts and no wards.  All precincts associated with a given ward fit entirely within that ward and provide full geographic coverage of the ward\u2019s area.  All wards and precincts associated with a given city fit entirely within that city and provide full geographic coverage of the city\u2019s area.",
      "thumbnail": "thumbnail/thumbnail.JPEG",
      "documentation": null,
      "extent": [
        [
          -73.53331942872688,
          41.23143095401706
        ],
        [
          -69.89856728952067,
          42.888320337738186
        ]
      ],
      "categories": [],
      "spatialReference": "102100",
      "accessInformation": "Office of the Secretary of the Commonwealth of Massachusetts \nMassachusetts Voting Precincts 2022\nBoston, MA\n\nma2020census@sec.state.ma.us\nhttp://www.sec.state.ma.us/",
      "classification": null,
      "licenseInfo": "<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;\"><DIV><DIV><P STYLE=\"margin:0 0 11 0;\"><SPAN>No warranty expressed or implied is made regarding the accuracy or utility of the data outside of the system it was processed on, or for general, political, or demographic purposes, nor shall the act of distribution constitute any such warranty. Neither the Massachusetts Secretary of the Commonwealth nor the Massachusetts Bureau of Geographic Information (MassGIS) shall be held liable for improper or incorrect use of the data described and/or contained herein<\/SPAN><SPAN>. <\/SPAN><SPAN>Please confirm that you are using the most recent copy of both data and metadata. Users of this data should not modify its contents to misrepresent the information contained within.<\/SPAN><\/P><P><SPAN /><\/P><\/DIV><\/DIV><\/DIV>",
      "culture": "en-us",
